{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Preposition Builder Master Pro》是一款以介詞為核心的英文文法學習遊戲，適合兒童及不同年齡的英語學生，透過把介詞放到正確位置來組成句子，提升語言能力。此 App 原價 US $6.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>趣味學習英文介詞</h2>\n<p>遊戲要求玩家把各級別的介詞放到正確位置，組成完整句子與諺語；級別由 Beginner 到 Expert，另設 Sayings 關卡。選錯介詞會有時間處罰，完成句子後會按速度及錯誤次數計分。玩家可透過線上多人模式或 Game Center 與全球玩家切磋。此遊戲由教育工作者設計，針對英文學習者常犯的介詞問題。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-125-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-126-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-127-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-128-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-129-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-130-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Preposition Builder Master Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-05T22:38:44.313007+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}